◆  Hooks · claude-code
│  The Adage plugin for Claude Code: its hooks, the band above the prompt, the pane and /adage,
│  with adage, adage-exec and adage-train bundled and verified at each session start.
│  adage stages it from this binary in ~/.local/share/adage/plugin, then runs:
│    claude plugin marketplace add ~/.local/share/adage/plugin
│    claude plugin install adage@adage-local
│
│  › The Adage plugin (recommended) · adage installs it with claude plugin
